/* DeepSeek V4 Flash — single-file pure-C engine.
 *
 * Generated by tools/amalgamate_deepseek.py from PR #165 (@DrewZt). Do not edit
 * by hand: rerun the generator. One .c per model family over shared
 * single-headers, the same shape as inkling.c and kimi_k3.c.
 *
 * Architecture: MLA + DSA sparse attention (index_topk 512, sliding_window 128),
 * 43 layers, 256 routed experts + 1 shared, top-6, sqrtsoftplus router with
 * noaux_tc, YaRN rope, 1 MTP layer. The native container is fp8-e4m3 dense with
 * UE8M0 block scales (128x128) plus fp4 experts; int4-g64 containers load
 * through the same paths.
 */
